* [Appwrite pricing](/pricing) to see what a referred developer gets when they upgrade to Pro
* [Announcing Appwrite Pro](/blog/post/announcing-appwrite-pro) for the plan that triggers a reward
* [Appwrite Startups program](/startups) and [Appwrite Education program](/education) for the other ways to get Cloud credits